include\tthe\tUnited\tKingdom, Luxembourg,\tCanada\tand\tthe\tNetherlands.\tU.S.\tincome\ttaxes\twere\tnot\tprovided\tfor\tcertain\tundistributed\tforeign\tearnings\tintended\tto\tbe\tindefinitely\treinvested\toutside\tthe\tUnited States.\n\n# Net\tIncome\tAttributable\tto\tBlackRock,\tInc.\n\nThe\tcomponents\tof\tnet\tincome\tattributable\tto\tBlackRock,\tInc.\tand\tnet\tincome\tattributable\tto\tBlackRock,\tInc.,\tas\tadjusted,\tfor\tthe\tyears\tended\tDecember\t31,\t2011\tand\t2010\tare\tas follows:\n\n|  | GAAP |  |  | As\tadjusted |  |  |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n|  | Year\\tended |  |  | Year\\tended |  |  |\n|  | December\\t31, |  | % | December\\t31, |  | % |\n| (Dollar\\tamounts\\tin\\tmillions,\\texcept\\tper\\tshare\\tdata) | 2011 | 2010 | Change | 2011 | 2010 | Change |\n| Operating\\tincome | \\t\\t $3,249 | $2,998 | 8% | $3,392 | $3,167 | 7% |\n| Non-operating\\tincome\\t(expense)^(1) | (116) | 36 | * | (113) | 25 | * |\n| Income\\ttax\\texpense | (796) | (971) | (18%) | (1,040) | (1,053) | (1%) |\n| Net\\tincome\\tattributable\\tto\\tBlackRock,\\tInc. | \\t\\t $2,337 | $2,063 | 13% | $2,239 | $2,139 | 5% |\n| %\\tattributable\\tto\\tcommon\\tshares | 99.1% | 98.6% |  | 99.1% | 98.6% |  |\n| Net\\tincome\\tattributable\\tto\\tcommon\\tshares | \\t\\t $2,315 | $2,033 | 14% | $2,218 | $2,109 | 5% |\n| Diluted\\tweighted-average\\tcommon\\tshares\\toutstanding^(2) | \\t 187,116,410 | \\t 192,692,047 | (3%) | \\t 187,116,410 | \\t 192,692,047 | (3%) |\n| Diluted\\tEPS: |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Operating\\tincome | \\t\\t $11.60 | $10.28 | 13% | $12.12 | $10.85 | 12% |\n| Non-operating\\tincome\\t(expense)^(1) | (0.41) | 0.12 | * | (0.40) | 0.09 | * |\n| Income\\ttax\\tbenefit | 1.18 | 0.15 | 687% | 0.13 | — | * |\n| Diluted\\tearnings\\tper\\tcommon\\tshare | \\t\\t $12.37 | $10.55 | 17% | $11.85 | $10.94 | 8% |\n\nNet\tof\tnet\tincome\t(loss)\tattributable\tto\tnon-controlling\tinterests\t(redeemable\tand\tnonredeemable). (1)\n\n